#: scenario:scenario_63B01B20_FFDA_4105_BCEF_4F9911C0B725
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65e160010b3a317c4f473a5e9f052af5a394e4c797c47d32250d885cc06e4746
#. default-sha256: e21dfe3ae45fe27c198fca100c4c3b597a201a1e03d358f0a8da0e3d744709ba
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_63B01B20_FFDA_4105_BCEF_4F9911C0B725"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫“The mansion had an alluring air of beauty about it in that era;⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫it was "
"almost like something out of a fairy tale.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫“A mansão tinha um ar sedutor de beleza naquela era;⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫era quase como algo "
"tirado de um conto de fadas.”"

#: scenario:scenario_D8C620F4_AD25_48DF_A912_D788A4C578D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d8ab8f63a6e0c794516fbb5617dd72abf6d2cc7b35366f47c4f1a74a7721d16
#. default-sha256: ae18a5b60c064d1a338fb83ec9790aa96a4f46a1940eda0ec29393fe8eae009f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D8C620F4_AD25_48DF_A912_D788A4C578D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫This period of history could perhaps be described as a symphony of destruction, as "
"cumbersome principles of old came crashing down."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Esse período da história poderia, talvez, ser descrito como uma sinfonia de destruição, "
"enquanto antigos princípios eram derrubados."

#: scenario:scenario_483E424D_25A2_4B03_8534_36B2371F1FA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 482d4b4c0a7c167dff293053b17f9493c7d88915b65724a221ec05a1f87686b7
#. default-sha256: bcec4f54456380c6ce1f8925d2daf769f05331224eb8a54b71ea1be61fc40067
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_483E424D_25A2_4B03_8534_36B2371F1FA3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Freed from the day-to-day oppression of these antiquated precepts, the people seemed to hark "
"back to the more poetic, expressive ways of old."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Livres da opressão diária de preceitos antiquados, as pessoas pareciam voltar aos ideais "
"mais expressivos e poéticos de outrora."

#: scenario:scenario_40443B05_EDC4_475C_BED6_60B08F7565D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9e117157d7c8c9a8d183e7527e57ffbc99a8a24f1cd9e800fbbd15b3c9655d7
#. default-sha256: 92b5b639758c66a669638e29e51c30b90192eaa6e35be09677cbace68b4c6df5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_40443B05_EDC4_475C_BED6_60B08F7565D0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They took these newly blossoming emotions in hand, and with them they wrote literature, "
"painted portraits, composed theatre, and found love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eles pegaram essas novas e florescentes emoções, e com elas escreveram literatura, pintaram "
"quadros, compuseram peças, e encontraram o amor."

#: scenario:scenario_CB4AB513_EC78_4644_B255_F6EB0C71B215
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb7c46e9fc72ae5b33f9a0183ae91af589d12f54d58db1474f04dec7e51f354e
#. default-sha256: 0825c1ec02c7520623e269c6d2b3439010590787d6267b33f8c9e50ea3734759
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CB4AB513_EC78_4644_B255_F6EB0C71B215"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even the Church, which had maintained authority throughout the Middle Ages, embraced the "
"changing times, adopting the culture’s flowering sense of aesthetic."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Até a Igreja, que manteve a autoridade por toda a Idade Média, aceitou os novos tempos, "
"adotando o senso de estética florescente na cultura."

#: scenario:scenario_E2D63C37_8B1E_4480_9979_811ED8FC0CC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f263d00d38d40ec34081458b395a74706512bc2b35a059304ede4bc46fcca605
#. default-sha256: e481bf659d928505c13fca66b6925a822d8b5403ea65e51e6acb71897ef61c47
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E2D63C37_8B1E_4480_9979_811ED8FC0CC5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫War would break out not twenty years from then, plucking the ripened era from the tree of "
"history—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but that is of no concern to us now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dentro de vinte anos, guerra estouraria, arrancando a era de amadurecimento da árvore da "
"história—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫mas isso não importa para nós agora."

#: scenario:scenario_FBF23873_677B_4F7E_90CB_56B4F9DEFC6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7771b8d806c5367ef901f89ec83e2e4f6cbaea3e7bf123a89b5c1f9a665ad24a
#. default-sha256: e83b5861a3f09c568da5d411262340f760b395d432c697b4ce32927c994809c4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FBF23873_677B_4F7E_90CB_56B4F9DEFC6E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At the time, it was still what people refer to as the Golden Age, a period of furor for all "
"who were there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Na época, ainda era o que viriam a chamar de Era de Ouro, um período de furor para quem a "
"viveu."

#: scenario:scenario_709FB765_6076_4326_9B5F_D37FB6CAD9F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5352b36546f7e1f6bae72e301e91624290e5c3471e3dda07440134d573cff8eb
#. default-sha256: 44da42f1036a7b8d1133e2d890e279f0561be798007e62388ac41362cef7939d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_709FB765_6076_4326_9B5F_D37FB6CAD9F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Now, let us take a slight detour."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Agora, vamos fazer um pequeno desvio."

#: scenario:scenario_BE59C5FE_F4DC_421A_9E7A_430A70556DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6f9c23584f0340c29e3359a2c65e6d5f7d8701dfa2a8d569833aaa5cf2f46d6
#. default-sha256: 95c7de5ea0e6f975b0f125c5771a087c6acc33e5f1e8d3513b16f29d8aa81beb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BE59C5FE_F4DC_421A_9E7A_430A70556DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, we will not be changing locations—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫this is a tale about the mansion, from "
"beginning to end. ⟪k:3⟫We ⟪k:4⟫will⟪k:5⟫, however, be moving through time. ⟪k:6⟫Say... ⟪k:7⟫about "
"eight years into the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não, não iremos trocar de local—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫do começo ao fim, este é um conto sobre a mansão. "
"⟪k:3⟫Nós ⟪k:4⟫vamos⟪k:5⟫, no entanto, nos deslocar pelo tempo. ⟪k:6⟫Digamos... ⟪k:7⟫cerca de oito "
"anos no passado."

#: scenario:scenario_9E3FFB8B_EAD7_43D7_A427_8C7BCE912ECA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55ef8677b81d84022cf8a261a8a99cf59f90dc44b27c17c2dab3bbe0f35b0054
#. default-sha256: 823ee0df0c6229778bf970404ed920410f6209254d1af0e2e9d0276acbf982ba
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9E3FFB8B_EAD7_43D7_A427_8C7BCE912ECA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A very wealthy family lived in the house then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Então, uma família muito rica morava na casa."

#: scenario:scenario_1562B177_D703_447B_A77E_920C52C76F1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce608cf3703e9f2e99bb1a69c81f0d7917a78114167662aeb791433775ea18f9
#. default-sha256: 01f0d19c449148a3b296039956b5f2db407e8da60dd295fdf11dc9de3bbc5695
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1562B177_D703_447B_A77E_920C52C76F1E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The mother and father, brother and sister all had distinctive, beautiful flaxen hair."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A mãe e o pai, o irmão e a irmã, todos tinham um distintos e belos cabelos de cor de linho."

#: scenario:scenario_20130EE8_E62A_48C8_AA1C_B8FAE8B6709E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77c64cb525c52943b3b502e40613b057d2df8c0a15dcda1ddc5aefd15180f17b
#. default-sha256: eff97c604bb1f4c9ac2bc4457930c858a561efebba038458389bfcf8e0289844
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20130EE8_E62A_48C8_AA1C_B8FAE8B6709E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was always enamored by their hair.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫By contrast, mine is the color of a wet crow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu sempre estive apaixonada pelos seus cabelos.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Em contraste, o meu é da cor de um "
"corvo molhado."

#: scenario:scenario_C31CB050_5A68_4BE8_82E7_B6AB10BCE924
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3145aede95eab01830cea8a59468f0d43dc347dcfa1ed787ea8f3bb5714c747e
#. default-sha256: c2794b83db162cb19b22b1b3df5b6aadbc899e0f51274a306f33f97ca5c5133f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C31CB050_5A68_4BE8_82E7_B6AB10BCE924"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫See? There I am, standing around, looking rather a fool."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Viu? Cá estou, parecendo uma boba."

#: scenario:scenario_E938425F_E243_4D5B_91A5_736A9F4D674B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40cfc5f6362a12d02924a03d25352d06c7b021b27739e126e3cb3b794c83fc36
#. default-sha256: 0c54854baea818f3096fb8cc4c5bf5a8ca0eaeb1c3ca7625e51fa910fe987a02
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E938425F_E243_4D5B_91A5_736A9F4D674B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was happy back then. ⟪k:1⟫And what reason did I have not to be, afforded the opportunity "
"to attend to such a beautiful home?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu era feliz na época. ⟪k:1⟫E que razão teria para não ser, tendo a oportunidade de cuidar "
"de tão belo lar?"

#: scenario:scenario_3C0ADA2C_7EE6_4AD3_855F_93B525DFB7DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c332d1e26aa6d75eed810c52d923af0146a4e1dc681b83a0866a885b59a93cbd
#. default-sha256: 3ac4a7908e12603222a41797c07825091beaf26b5daf2ae5562dd5ad27d23abc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3C0ADA2C_7EE6_4AD3_855F_93B525DFB7DD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I poured my heart into serving that family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Então eu servi àquela família com todo meu coração."

#: scenario:scenario_BB69FD67_0E0B_4E42_A52D_C46BE2D4A149
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfef5cf9be02951c4da0467dca8f62f52c8055e7cffb467c5e56a39b368fe029
#. default-sha256: 13b4a8915d3043ae9e6d3fa65e5a87cfec377796f64122f0a492ce552954236d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BB69FD67_0E0B_4E42_A52D_C46BE2D4A149"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Listen closely, if you would. ⟪k:1⟫That soft, fleeting sound that could only be a young "
"girl singing—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫can you hear it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Se puder, escute com atenção. ⟪k:1⟫Esse som suave e fugaz que só poderia ser de uma "
"garotinha cantando—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫consegue escutar?"

#: scenario:scenario_17D4D6FE_C596_4A24_83F8_5EA3C565E1E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7467998e27d10070241ffd4b2ec71c5c0775da263ad6973f1cca659d16bc4537
#. default-sha256: fb8ee8855502daa9c2724f75d129000893665a3ed53380bd1165a01173c86bb4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_17D4D6FE_C596_4A24_83F8_5EA3C565E1E9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lalalaa, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫lalaalalaa..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lalalaa, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫lalaalalaa..."

#: scenario:scenario_BCAEF6C0_53CC_4049_865E_85DAAB53B84D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49309498cbfda09a2b2cdf925f8f463efcc7c8b70225c25fc6cdce03b93e3eea
#. default-sha256: 99db124c446484cbbb899f58948c898201a80ce93f61d04be0485e58e3ffe416
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BCAEF6C0_53CC_4049_865E_85DAAB53B84D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The girl you see, cheerfully picking crimson roses and singing like a songbird, was called "
"Nellie."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A garota que você vê, alegremente colhendo rosas carmesins e cantando como uma ave canora, "
"se chamava Nellie."

#: scenario:scenario_E7A5DDF4_1895_4A80_A519_9B2F5069A053
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c500c341bc1a55071b617944984ada1d142dd5af5fce1733de21f0e4b039da9
#. default-sha256: 74f90ba2ef9ca1678f5980fff48be7d455de7d876d7e3c25b8a8fed0e6d7a51d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E7A5DDF4_1895_4A80_A519_9B2F5069A053"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though young, she sang with elegance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Apesar de jovem, ela cantava com elegância."

#: scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D080
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47d5db12114e7463e596c5e949d6aa6a22565c339bff8bde302e7efd365fee7f
#. default-sha256: e636b67c2876d3d585054f3c85e8a6ced05cb6df3660e16dbef70ab23aab2026
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D080"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie was deeply fond of the house’s garden, and she would often spend her afternoons there."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nellie era muito apegada ao jardim da casa, e com frequência passava suas tardes lá."

#: scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D079
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e5df80d2941024e4b1b26824c930e55ea233d54f24104fcae535aa1ca32d32d
#. default-sha256: a4fc3bc49469946f99d421e9a5b8aa6ace14b0143070aedafe9a4cd4a66e61a0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D079"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Gorgeous roses gathered from all across the world bloomed in the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Rosas deslumbrantes coletadas no mundo todo floresceram naquele jardim."

#: scenario:scenario_EC6C57EC_D4F8_4A1F_B30C_E07EB8B58D40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91455d8362ca9ed044b92f3fc828f9857c8eaf39db74a99a61e023e3534237af
#. default-sha256: 53a8595d74e9c35d3cc2b5770191efb1aaf89272239e48ef9d0e62fbc3b733fb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EC6C57EC_D4F8_4A1F_B30C_E07EB8B58D40"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They were given the utmost care, and even had their thorns removed—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A elas era dado o máximo dos cuidados, e até seus espinhos foram removidos—"

#: scenario:scenario_EAA05CB3_88C5_42E0_84F0_D2378A066978
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47cfda25d499567b0a77d5f8bf9ca0859b710192674bc6b77f9903237a3f2d55
#. default-sha256: 37fbe112e35b60315f3e78efe3d7e709858083877dec0243fdccc04c1fb4f881
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EAA05CB3_88C5_42E0_84F0_D2378A066978"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so young Nellie would not hurt herself, naturally."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫para que a pequena Nellie não se ferisse, naturalmente."

#: scenario:scenario_9AD3568A_CE83_4EC9_931B_09C984521DFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec3404262a7ec3237199c46621aed73b131e895d8ff31f3ebc89ad8c43f7415d
#. default-sha256: 83c9f16a4c89a16c1936a8bb5c05d8b91c523cc83c71385a86a6940372945962
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9AD3568A_CE83_4EC9_931B_09C984521DFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The light-brown-haired girl carefully plucked petals from the roses, gathering them up as "
"she sang."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A menina de cabelo-marrom-claro arrancava as pétalas das rosas com cuidado, juntando-as "
"enquanto cantava."

#: scenario:scenario_06BC61C6_E389_43D4_8C67_096FB58E00E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc66bcd9356a4271b10918ecd375dc605e894b5984d0c9bc608c3bf67401c998
#. default-sha256: 6fadb24f55e75a2a2b0925f89acfec79acdc1b511a4de8e779656ee6e9d0ef15
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_06BC61C6_E389_43D4_8C67_096FB58E00E1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her voice was like music played by faeries—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫nay, the sight of her was like an angel "
"descended from Heaven."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A voz dela era como música tocada por fadas—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫não, sua visão dela era como um anjo "
"descido do Céu."

#: scenario:scenario_33BFA7B0_96A3_45D2_B656_A80E8A602FC7
