msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Little bird, little bird, singing night and day.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫For your little birdy heart, "
"sing your woes away.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Pretty flowers all around, all around the little birds.⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Passarinho, passarinho, cantando noite e dia.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Para o seu coraçãozinho de "
"pássaro, cante suas aflições.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Lindas flores ao redor, ao redor dos passarinhos⟪k:6⟫"

