#: scenario:scenario_CD482BA8_A73A_4792_99CF_38E3C49F8D14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebeafa1da4f962702f0ae91b05dd074bea133c2bcf7660b4dfe67dcce77660ee
