msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CD482BA8_A73A_4792_99CF_38E3C49F8D14"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie was, as a matter of fact, not the only visitor to the rose garden that day. ⟪k:1⟫She "
"always came with her older brother, Mell."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie não era, na realidade, a única visitante do jardim de rosas naquele dia. ⟪k:1⟫Ela "
"sempre vinha com seu irmão mais velho, Mell."

#: scenario:scenario_7A9E35EF_61A0_4E46_A820_3FB9C3BD4276
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c44da730103c55484e8f52d535a7f2bf0b47e9988e3cbbd1931376cb6c3c5c8c
