msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7A9E35EF_61A0_4E46_A820_3FB9C3BD4276"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The young siblings were inseparable. ⟪k:1⟫Mell adored his little sister, who in turn pined "
"for his attention."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Os pequenos irmãos eram inseparáveis. ⟪k:1⟫Mell adorava sua irmãzinha, que por sua vez era "
"ávida por sua atenção."

#: scenario:scenario_6297F308_1089_41ED_B599_88622EEB5CFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e3120cddc6ce39b12b8c5d5b01262adff4ceae1ddedb86f1af5e7c2447c2d6c
#. default-sha256: 48d533619659ac1391d55931936364fdb61969f5a6ebeaa8439135851391b018
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6297F308_1089_41ED_B599_88622EEB5CFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sight of the two innocent children cuddling together—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫not yet shackled by fear "
"for the future—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was truly heartwarming."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A visão do afeto mútuo entre as duas crianças inocentes—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫não ainda acorrentadas "
"pelo medo do futuro—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫era realmente comovente."

#: scenario:scenario_48D24DEF_2DA4_4798_9B13_66395CFC917D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7905acaf5f15b70f42bdf8507100d0bb14bc878c2ef20289dd63b7dc59061300
#. default-sha256: 36c35a5a30dea8b1a10c0486d89326ee2b1758541a9d200edf9fd2ebba91de4b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_48D24DEF_2DA4_4798_9B13_66395CFC917D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That day, Mell was sitting in the shade of a tree reading a book. ⟪k:1⟫As I am sure you are "
"aware, in their time, books could not yet be mass produced."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Naquele dia, Mell estava sentado na sombra de uma árvore, lendo um livro. ⟪k:1⟫Tenho certeza "
"de que já sabia, mas, na época deles, livros ainda não podiam ser produzidos em massa."

#: scenario:scenario_5FA5021E_D160_466F_8EB1_C05FDA1A31C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61ca83541009d16c40a45908b955ca72ad0e08c8337d0310510e592f0e4c14d3
