msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell was a clever boy. ⟪k:1⟫He had attended church from a very young age, where a priest "
"would instruct him in Latin grammar."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell era um menino inteligente. ⟪k:1⟫ Ele frequentava a igreja desde muito jovem, onde um "
"sacerdote lhe ensinava a gramática do latim."

#: scenario:scenario_4B1407FC_77A8_4A4B_995D_9B1FDDB3075A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53496084f65a6e04e46b94c8169206143ff06f258940e206c6e508812da5877c
